- 121 English reduction uses exact Romanizations Alf/Lmd/Hey/Yod/Mem/Ayn/Tav. Changing spelling may change output.
- 11 full Hebrew name letters; 9 letters in אלהים עמית; 8 letters in אלהים אחד.
- NEVER call the experimental 9%/39/142 ranking or harmony counts a ranking of corpus discoveries. Educational P/R/S is about reading difficulty only.
- Avoid unsupported identifications such as treating selected numerical matches as historical proof.

